From: Harshkamdar67 <harshkamdar67@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 00:14:39 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 15/32] ggml, vulkan: fused Inkling 2 SITU activation

GGML_OP_INKLING_SITU applies k*tanh(g/beta)*sigmoid(g)*tanh(u/lb) to a fused gate/up row in
one op instead of seven. B60: decode 38.8 -> 39.1, two-token steps 63.9 -> 65.2, pp512
1185 -> 1278, pp2048 1165 -> 1254 tok/s; wikitext-2 PPL 7.6834.
